  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's motion and perception capabilities, separating motion commands from sensor events. The specification enforces safe, coverage-oriented exploration: random_walk is used in clear states, move_forward is used for short progress, and obstacle events trigger conservative, deterministic recovery turns. Full_rotate is reserved for rare, fully-blocked cases. All transitions are deterministic and respect the required event semantics and safety constraints.",
  "strategy": [
    "Separate plant automata for motion and perception to reflect hardware modularity and event separation.",
